rude and hence replaced with the onomatopoeia. Compare Swedish tvi, imitative of spitting and used as a spoken onomatopoeia alternative to spitting three times to ward off bad luck. Compare also the idea of touching wood, the equivalent of which in German-speaking Europe is to knock on wood three times.\nIt is possible, though unprovable, that the specific form of the onomatopoeia might have been reinforced by the word Teufel (“devil”, with the superstitious idea that saying something negative will have a positive effect, compare Hals- und Beinbruch) or by Yiddish טוב (tov, “good”)."]],"senses":[[372800,"toi, toi, toi","intj","good luck; an expression of encouragement",0,null,["colloquial"]],[372801,"toi, toi, toi","intj","knock on wood; a superstitious expression used to avoid the negative consequences of some utterance",1,null,["colloquial"]]]},"unempfindlichere":{"entries":[["unempfindlichere",null,null,null]],"senses":[[211639,"unempfindlichere","adj","inflection of unempfindlich:",0],[211640,"unempfindlichere","adj","strong/mixed nominative/accusative feminine singular comparative degree",1],[211641,"unempfindlichere","adj","strong nominative/accusative plural comparative degree",2],[211642,"unempfindlichere","adj","weak nominative all-gender singular comparative degree",3],[211643,"unempfindlichere","adj","weak accusative feminine/neuter singular comparative degree",4]],"inflections":[["unempfindlichere","unempfindlich","comparative,feminine,nominative,singular,strong,without-article"]]},"verrufes":{"entries":[["verrufes",null,null,null]],"senses":[[633370,"verrufes","noun","genitive singular of Verruf",0]],"inflections":[["verrufes","verruf","genitive"]]},"wallonisches":{"entries":[["wallonisches",null,null,null]],"senses":[[581017,"wallonisches","adj","strong/mixed nominative/accusative neuter singular of wallonisch",0]],"inflections":[["wallonisches","wallonisch","neuter,nominative,singular,strong,without-article"]]},"waschest":{"entries":[["waschest",null,